      "writtenOn": "2020-12-03T22:43:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think this makes sense.  When the value is decreased to zero we should not return a new blob. When the value is decreased to a non-zero value (when that\u0027s allowed, in the future) the prior blob will be disabled by finish(), so if anyone attempts to use it again it will be just be an invalid blob and ErrorCode::INVALID_KEY_BLOB should be returned.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 328,
        "startChar": 52,
        "endLine": 330,
        "endChar": 42
      },
      "revId": "e0a1f6bbbc690270fda7172d1f3c9c6668b05aee",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c14fd6b4_20d29788",
