        "id": 1043663
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-12-03T22:43:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As above, we should just never return a blob in that case.\n\nHowever, in KeyMint1 we\u0027re not going to update the signature of finish() to return the blob, so maybe we just shouldn\u0027t even talk about how this will work. Attempting to use a deleted key blob just returns INVALID_KEY_BLOB.",
